    "UIName": "Wasp WSP-7MAF",
    "Id": "mechdef_wasp_WSP-7MAF",
    "Name": "Wasp WSP-7MAF",
    "Details": "This variant uses an XL engine on an endo steel frame to propel the Wasp up to 129 km/h. It also mounts enough jump jets to match, with a maximum range of 240 meters per jump. It has to use this speed to good effect, as it is only protected by three tons of armor. The right arm medium laser was upgraded to an ER medium laser, and the design uses 10 double heat sinks to dissipate waste heat. Finally, a MML-5 with two tons of ammunition gives it a decent punch at all ranges. In order to make room for these upgrades, a small cockpit and XL gyro are also used.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.97</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "wasp"
  },
